If you can tolerate the risk of not getting enough corpses and/or
being unlucky with the % chance of PR, wish for 2 or 3 cursed scrolls
of genocide and reverse-genocide shriekers. Or better yet, unicorns
(preferably in Sokoban, and let your pet do as much of the dirty work
as possible), which will get you u-horns as well as (a good chance of)
poison resistance. With luck, you'll get more than one scroll, which
you can then bless and use on the monster class of your choice, and if
not you at least know the scroll for future writing. If you generate
co-aligned unicorns and are careful not to let your pet kill them all,
you also have easy access to luck-raising and gem (partial) ID.


